-- out of text: Income Support Regulations 1987 reg 2(1) ('benefit week'): the first day of the beneficiary's first benefit week to commence on or after 6th April 2026 is an input.
-- (g), (i), (j), (k), (l), (m): "in so far as they relate to a particular beneficiary, on the first day of the
-- first benefit week to commence for that beneficiary on or after 6th April 2026". The benefit week is
-- defined in each parent instrument (not among the inputs), so the first day of that week is an input. A
-- date before 6th April 2026 cannot be the first day of such a week: NOTHING (not covered).
-- src:32 | (g) articles 20, 21 and 22, in so far as they relate to a particular beneficiary, on the first day of the first benefit week to commence for that beneficiary on or after 6th April 2026, and for the purpose of this sub-paragraph “benefit week” has the same meaning as in the Income Support Regulations;
